:25+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165553192,"discussion_id":"75dd599ab182969627619e698dc48299819cd2f4","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n优化MoE（Mixture of Experts）路由初始化算子中数据收集（Gather）操作的SIMT实现。主要解决了原实现中使用了两个独立的队列来管理同一份索引数据（`expandedRowIdx`）的问题，通过移除冗余队列来简化内存管理和数据流，提升代码清晰度和潜在的执行效率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将原本用于存储`expandedRowIdx`索引数据的两个队列（`expandDstToSrcRowCopyInQueue`和`expandedRowIdxIndexCopyInQueue`）合并为一个。具体修改包括：删除冗余队列的声明和初始化，并将所有相关的内存分配、入队、出队和释放操作统一迁移至保留的`expandedRowIdxIndexCopyInQueue`队列。此修改简化了数据流，减少了不必要的内存分配和管理开销。","created_at":"2026-03-17T20:29:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T20:29:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165553199,"discussion_id":"a62eb481e78d2d16fbbef607978a8a4294b5d604","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-17T20:29:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-17T20:29:30+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165967156,"discussion_id":"24dad4171e518d5a577db32547aca262b70697d0","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull re